  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Muni Kiran Sambapalem vs The State Of Ap on 11 September, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Honourable Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.3837 of 2020 O R D E R:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 by the petitioners, who are Accused No.1 and 2, seeking to quash the proceedings in FIR No.419 of 2020 on the file of Nawabpet Police Station, SPSR Nellore District.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioners has placed reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of FSS Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioners has placed reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of FSS Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
